<title>BELGIUM: BRUSSELS HILTON BOMB ALARM BLOCKS TRAFFIC.</title>
<headline>BRUSSELS HILTON BOMB ALARM BLOCKS TRAFFIC.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A bomb alarm at the Brussels Hilton hotel has blocked all traffic in the Avenue Louise/Avenue de la Toison d'Or area, Belgian radio said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Belgian army's demining unit has blown up a suspect package in front of the hotel, the radio said. It was not yet sure whether the package was a bomb indeed.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
